#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:1 ddf50df2155e4958b61e2457dfaaa22b
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:3 b68a05419d93465280d7ea314863da72
msgid "Frequently asked questions and common troubleshooting solutions."
msgstr "常见问题与故障排除方案。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:5 d202310a1911466994499e11ba78a49e
msgid "Installation Issues"
msgstr "安装问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:7 9fe815b0ec664b9b950b74dc8b82c393
msgid ""
"Q: `apt` cannot find `python3-colcon-common-extensions` / "
"`python3-rosdep` / `python3-vcstool`"
msgstr ""
"问：`apt` 找不到 `python3-colcon-common-extensions` / `python3-rosdep` / "
"`python3-vcstool`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:9 b23fe070f3f54920b46a8cceb1cf2fb5
msgid ""
"Those packages are in the ROS 2 apt index, not stock Ubuntu. On a bare "
"24.04 host or container, add the ROS key + Noble ROS 2 source, then `apt "
"update`, **before** installing them. Full order: [Install "
"Environment](2-install_environment.md). fishros is an optional shortcut, "
"not the only path."
msgstr ""
"这些包在 ROS 2 apt 索引里，不在原版 Ubuntu。在裸 24.04 主机或容器上，先添加 ROS 密钥 + Noble 的 ROS 2"
" 源，再 `apt "
"update`，**然后**才安装它们。完整顺序：[环境安装](2-install_environment.md)。fishros "
"是可选捷径，不是唯一路径。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:11 98242f8fab494fb5be4f1cfc38a2ef61
msgid "Q: rosdep init fails with \"already initialized\""
msgstr "问： rosdep init fails with \\\"already initialized\\\""

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:13 a1300588557b4602a0fd8a6ac4e19280
msgid "This is normal if you've used ROS 2 before. Just run update:"
msgstr "如果以前使用过 ROS 2，这是正常现象。直接执行更新即可："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:15 f17fa7baa96e4425938b0740bff4f7a9
msgid "rosdep update\n"
msgstr "rosdep update\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:19 45ac5a9ac66f472484a7fbd6f18cb005
msgid "Q: Package not found after apt install"
msgstr "问：apt install 后找不到软件包"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:21 270daf6a64534dd3b30370147d6a43d1
msgid ""
"This applies to packages that **are** in the ROS apt index (for example "
"`ros-jazzy-desktop`) after the ROS 2 apt source exists. After ROS is "
"installed, clone a deploy workspace and run `./init_repo.sh`, then "
"`source install/setup.bash` after `colcon build`."
msgstr ""
"这适用于 ROS 2 apt 源已存在之后、**确实**在 ROS apt 索引中的软件包（例如 `ros-jazzy-desktop`）。装好 "
"ROS 后，克隆部署工作区并运行 `./init_repo.sh`，`colcon build` 之后 `source "
"install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:23 4cbd4d7e1f354e06a88018e396a13492
msgid "sudo apt update\n"
msgstr "sudo apt update\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:27 d2c9778b49bb4bd189082bbd776cca61
msgid "Q: OCS2 `.deb` not found via apt"
msgstr "问：用 apt 找不到 OCS2 `.deb`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:29 71f7f4bb1521490daf97a1f88158721f
msgid ""
"OCS2 is **not** published to ROS 2 / Ubuntu apt software sources. `sudo "
"apt install ros-jazzy-ocs2` will not find it."
msgstr ""
"OCS2 **没有**发布到 ROS 2 / Ubuntu apt 软件源。`sudo apt install ros-jazzy-ocs2` "
"找不到该包。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:31 1ec1d27fedca4225a77053351d9c99bb
msgid ""
"**Primary path:** in `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws`, run "
"`./init_repo.sh`. Choose `d` for OCS2 (menu 1), switch source ↔ deb with "
"menu **2**, or install/update with menu **3** "
"(`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`)."
msgstr ""
"**主路径：** 在 `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws` 中运行 `./init_repo.sh`。给 OCS2 "
"选 `d`（菜单 1），用菜单 **2** 在源码 ↔ deb 之间切换，或用菜单 **3** "
"安装/更新（`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:33 ae3b163a0e0e4f399f2707c03e48d8b5
msgid "To build from source, choose `s` during init (or menu 2)."
msgstr "要从源码构建，在 init（或菜单 2）时选 `s`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:35 441b1398c38b4b51be27e0093a86f1d8
msgid "Manual fallback"
msgstr "手动回退"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:38 2b297516f8e94d7792c4aa38641a3998
msgid ""
"Download the matching asset from [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) and `sudo dpkg "
"-i ros-jazzy-ocs2_*.deb` only if you are not using a deploy workspace."
msgstr ""
"仅当你没有使用部署工作空间时，才从 [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) 下载匹配资源并执行 `sudo"
" dpkg -i ros-jazzy-ocs2_*.deb`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:41 a6d5d8b392e94593a45714f2a5760d9c
msgid "Submodule Issues"
msgstr "子模块问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:43 f15f37ed55984378959c07e280ec5d40
msgid "Q: Submodules are empty after clone"
msgstr "问：克隆后子模块为空"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:45 a32b66c8ab444b33b34121aa73158215
msgid ""
"In `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws`, re-run `./init_repo.sh` (menu 1). "
"In FaSim-Isaac / fa-py-libraries / lerobot_ros2, re-run that repo’s "
"`./init.sh` (or `./init.sh all`). Do not start with a recursive `git "
"submodule update --init --recursive`."
msgstr ""
"在 `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws` 中再跑 `./init_repo.sh`（菜单 1）。在 FaSim-"
"Isaac / fa-py-libraries / lerobot_ros2 中再跑该仓库的 `./init.sh`（或 `./init.sh "
"all`）。不要从递归的 `git submodule update --init --recursive` 开始。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:47 f6a944f7440a460f96a1d4aee4231a16
msgid "Q: `error: cannot run ssh: No such file or directory`"
msgstr "问：`error: cannot run ssh: No such file or directory`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:49 71458689c4a24642bb9d70f7700ef46a
msgid ""
"[`.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/.gitmodules) uses `git@github.com:…`. `git config "
"url.https://github.com/.insteadOf git@github.com:` alone does **not** fix"
" `git submodule update` (nested repos read their own `.gitmodules` and "
"call `ssh`). Current `./init_repo.sh` on `main` temporarily rewrites "
"those URLs to HTTPS. Force with `--https` / `OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1`. "
"Steps: [open-deploy-ws Setup](3-open_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr ""
"[`.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/.gitmodules) 使用 `git@github.com:…`。仅设置 `git config "
"url.https://github.com/.insteadOf git@github.com:` **不能**修好 `git "
"submodule update`（嵌套仓读自己的 `.gitmodules` 并直接调 `ssh`）。当前 `main` 上的 "
"`./init_repo.sh` 会临时把这些 URL 改写成 HTTPS。用 `--https` / "
"`OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1` 强制。步骤：[open-deploy-ws 配置](3-open_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:51 9ec99de311af433da1f5ee65ce038439
msgid "Q: How do I run `init_repo.sh` in CI / a container (no TTY)?"
msgstr "问：如何在 CI / 容器（无 TTY）里运行 `init_repo.sh`？"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:53 8c17c03288d1427ca836adee2e083000
msgid "On current open-deploy-ws `main`:"
msgstr "当前 open-deploy-ws `main` 上："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:55 37278a913f4842bdb1c7e8d3c2d2656e
msgid "./init_repo.sh --public --ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source\n"
msgstr "./init_repo.sh --public --ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:59 bc313bb875e34159b6db9c075433683d
msgid ""
"Same defaults as the interactive menu. Also: `--https` / "
"`OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1`, `-y` / `--yes`, and env "
"`OPEN_DEPLOY_VISIBILITY`, `OPEN_DEPLOY_OCS2`, `OPEN_DEPLOY_ARMS`, "
"`OPEN_DEPLOY_COMMON`. `./init_repo.sh --help` lists the rest. If your "
"checkout predates these flags, pull `main`."
msgstr ""
"默认值与交互菜单相同。另外还有：`--https` / `OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1`、`-y` / "
"`--yes`，以及环境变量 "
"`OPEN_DEPLOY_VISIBILITY`、`OPEN_DEPLOY_OCS2`、`OPEN_DEPLOY_ARMS`、`OPEN_DEPLOY_COMMON`。其余见"
" `./init_repo.sh --help`。若你的检出早于这些参数，先拉取 `main`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:61 aa2a4698ba1e48039bbe79c1ca1202b4
msgid "Q: Access denied to submodule"
msgstr "问：子模块访问被拒绝"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:63 06a7e6e7de794043ba047ac3549365f9
msgid ""
"This usually means you're trying to access a private submodule without "
"proper access, or the remote is still SSH and this machine has no key."
msgstr "这通常表示正在访问没有权限的私有子模块，或远程仍是 SSH 而本机没有密钥。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:65 22cf04f79f844737ad254fcd66e53d16
msgid ""
"**For open-deploy-ws:** Only public submodules should be needed. Check "
"that:"
msgstr "**对于 open-deploy-ws：** 只需公开子模块。请确认："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:66 2108a12347c7466a8e97c10f1505609b
msgid "You're on the correct branch"
msgstr "当前位于正确的分支"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:67 d9747738e07c4a9bb94d0e42b2c984f9
msgid "The submodule is listed as public in `submodules_visibility.conf`"
msgstr "该子模块在 `submodules_visibility.conf` 中列为公开"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:68 ab819bdd64d14fc8b3cbab728622977e
msgid ""
"You have `ssh` + a key, or you passed `--https` / "
"`OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1`"
msgstr "已有 `ssh` + 密钥，或已传入 `--https` / `OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:70 d04cbe2e83ca4c84bd470f5f94744375
msgid ""
"**For fa-deploy-ws:** Verify your GitHub SSH key has access to private "
"repos:"
msgstr "**对于 fa-deploy-ws：** 确认你的 GitHub SSH 密钥有权访问私有仓库："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:72 427394f6a2ea42a29f02da0c0dbeae12
msgid "ssh -T git@github.com\n"
msgstr "ssh -T git@github.com\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:76 c15b5ccb91ce4402899402596a92cca6
msgid "Q: Submodule conflicts during update"
msgstr "问：更新时出现子模块冲突"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:78 55c3fdfce73e4f36905aaa153a7dc0c3
msgid ""
"git submodule foreach git checkout .\n"
"git submodule update --init\n"
msgstr ""
"git submodule foreach git checkout .\n"
"git submodule update --init\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:83 7fc7c2c30a9147b28f6f3a90136106e8
msgid "Build Issues"
msgstr "编译问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:85 4935ade9ff3e44d1a39859be6784b51e
msgid "Q: colcon fails on an empty directory under `arms_ros2_control`"
msgstr "问：colcon 在 `arms_ros2_control` 下的空目录失败"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:87 fcc18d3e1ec74469a8d91d744cee2fc0
msgid ""
"Public init leaves private nested modules empty "
"(`controller/ocs2_wbc_controller`, `libraries/lina_planning`, "
"`libraries/ocs2_humanoid`, and uninitialized `hardwares/*`). Current "
"public-mode `./init_repo.sh` writes `COLCON_IGNORE` on those empty dirs. "
"If colcon still walks one (old checkout), pull `main` and re-run init, or"
" `touch <empty-dir>/COLCON_IGNORE`. Details: [open-deploy-ws "
"Setup](3-open_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr ""
"public "
"初始化会把私有嵌套模块留空（`controller/ocs2_wbc_controller`、`libraries/lina_planning`、`libraries/ocs2_humanoid`，以及未初始化的"
" `hardwares/*`）。当前 public 模式的 `./init_repo.sh` 会给这些空目录写入 "
"`COLCON_IGNORE`。若 colcon 仍会走进其中某个目录（旧检出），先拉取 `main` 并再跑 `./init_repo.sh`，或 "
"`touch <empty-dir>/COLCON_IGNORE`。细节：[open-deploy-ws "
"配置](3-open_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:89 7275668f90a84f92b7c8f26863e4ed5b
msgid "Q: Where is Taku?"
msgstr "问：Taku 在哪里？"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:91 e13cdabc2881438e89f1f638bad1d048
msgid ""
"On `robot_descriptions` branch **`feature/agilex`** at "
"`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description` — not on the default `main` submodule "
"pin. Launch: `ros2 launch robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py "
"robot:=taku` ([package README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description/README.md))."
" There is no lean `open-deploy-ws` Taku branch. Checkout steps: [open-"
"deploy-ws Setup](3-open_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr ""
"在 `robot_descriptions` 分支 **`feature/agilex`** 的 "
"`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description` — 不在默认钉住的 `main` 子模块上。启动：`ros2 launch "
"robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=taku`（[包 "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description/README.md)）。没有精简的"
" `open-deploy-ws` Taku 分支。检出步骤：[open-deploy-ws 配置](3-open_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:93 5d96f1bb8914447f8df317d1f318278b
msgid "Q: colcon build fails with missing dependency"
msgstr "问：colcon build 因缺少依赖而失败"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:95 276664000ea449d198c3641cfcc05ba7
msgid "Install dependencies via rosdep:"
msgstr "通过 rosdep 安装依赖："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:97 2cf998c7723d47debc39cd2fee9aaddd
msgid "rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -r -y\n"
msgstr "rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -r -y\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:101 52035a1943964927bb4efefb4b1a0b77
msgid "Q: numpy version conflict"
msgstr "问：numpy 版本冲突"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:103 2ac5827cb7064aa4936d2358dc55f0e1
msgid "Some packages require numpy < 2:"
msgstr "部分软件包要求 numpy < 2："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:105 33bcf8c37ae948edb94b60e9496480d4
msgid "pip install 'numpy<2'\n"
msgstr "pip install 'numpy<2'\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:109 6f5a3cffc7f1405591f1d7be8aaef823
msgid "Q: CMake cannot find package"
msgstr "问：CMake 找不到软件包"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:111 a5174a877db24dbb8e6c1b93449b440b
msgid ""
"Build from a workspace that already ran `./init_repo.sh`. If `ros2` / "
"`colcon` is missing, finish [Install "
"Environment](2-install_environment.md) first. After a successful build, "
"`source install/setup.bash` in the launch terminal."
msgstr ""
"在已经跑过 `./init_repo.sh` 的工作区构建。若缺少 `ros2` / `colcon`，先完成 "
"[安装环境](2-install_environment.md)。构建成功后，在启动终端 `source install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:113 bd5626bc9bf54840b469e3af12a5f0de
msgid "Q: Build runs out of memory"
msgstr "问：编译时内存不足"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:115 2cf24dd9f9bf46f892ecda6e26de1a7e
msgid "Limit parallel jobs:"
msgstr "限制并行任务数："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:117 07fc674357a64a7b8d150385ce58d6a6
msgid "colcon build --parallel-workers 2\n"
msgstr "colcon build --parallel-workers 2\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:121 2cab1c2316d94d9cb35ee825c03a3b12
msgid "Or build specific packages:"
msgstr "或者只编译指定软件包："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:123 d11a8c1a51e34b73b139bac186c5fd41
msgid "colcon build --packages-up-to <package-name>\n"
msgstr "colcon build --packages-up-to <package-name>\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:127 9dd86ee81f79473abe765caaf90a7547
msgid "Runtime Issues"
msgstr "运行时问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:129 0b29709cf3154a0ab72a899e16031c4b
msgid "Q: Node/topic not found"
msgstr "问：找不到节点/话题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:131 ef1c10c1584e42c6848b8fc807dba82f
msgid "Ensure workspace is sourced:"
msgstr "确认已加载工作空间环境："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:133 9b0a54ea24b14e61826d9fac86605a1a
msgid "source install/setup.bash\n"
msgstr "source install/setup.bash\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:137 47a07e5a2be24d639d7fc5b107df799f
msgid "Check if the node is running:"
msgstr "检查节点是否在运行："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:139 225c10f8d16541b896dea8b5afe90f91
msgid ""
"ros2 node list\n"
"ros2 topic list\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 node list\n"
"ros2 topic list\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:144 08b186f80b254a9e99155b89f55f5ed5
msgid "Q: Controller fails to start"
msgstr "问：控制器无法启动"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:146 4b81cbd0fa0c43858586bd1f6b558ff5
msgid "Check that:"
msgstr "请检查："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:147 6ebb0c2b06874f8eb0caff95eeb479f8
msgid ""
"Hardware parameter matches your setup (`mock_components`, `gz`, `isaac`, "
"or `real` — there is no `hardware:=mock`)"
msgstr "硬件参数与当前环境匹配（`mock`、`gz`、`isaac` 或真实硬件）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:148 10de1b6659eb495a93159fa22b554ded
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Robot parameter matches a `{key}_description` package"
msgstr "机器人参数与可用描述包匹配"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:149 f685440728b14f6eb891e4f8ea37d1de
msgid "Required hardware interfaces are initialized"
msgstr "所需硬件接口已初始化"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:151 cc62c716feac412ea76924c4108650af
msgid "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py\n"
msgstr "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:155 fa0a12ad67e94785b8b02dbcb1504b7a
msgid "Q: No communication between machines"
msgstr "问：机器之间无法通信"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:157 ee5fedc28f5d42bc9484a7efc0188220
msgid "Verify:"
msgstr "请确认："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:158 46d7ae0032a24e28a07443f8298fb59f
msgid "ROS Domain ID matches on both machines"
msgstr "两台机器上的 ROS Domain ID 一致"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:159 33d337341df145cf93c64f40c34ebcaa
msgid "Network connectivity exists"
msgstr "网络连通正常"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:160 816280b575684837ab3a330f79a0b36e
msgid "Firewall allows ROS 2 traffic"
msgstr "防火墙允许 ROS 2 通信"

